### Test AI Assistant service bang extension REST Client trong VS Code
### Can chay: Identity (5101), AiAssistant (5106). Can API key (xem HUONG-DAN-THAN.md muc AI)
@host = http://localhost:5106
@identity = http://localhost:5101

### 1. Service con song khong -> 200 {"status":"ok"}
GET {{host}}/health

### 2. Dang nhap lay token
# @name login
POST {{identity}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "champ@test.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 3. Hoi AI che do Care Plan -> 200 {"reply":"..."} (503 neu chua dat API key)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "care",
  "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "Make a weekly care plan for my Money Tree on my desk." } ]
}

### 4. Che do Feng Shui
POST {{host}}/api/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "fengshui",
  "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "Which plant is lucky for a new home?" } ]
}

### 5. Mode sai -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "abc",
  "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "hi" } ]
}

### 6. Tin cuoi khong phai cua user -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "care",
  "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "hi" }, { "role": "assistant", "content": "hello" } ]
}

### 7. Khong gui token -> 401 (bao mat)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "care", "messages": [ { "role": "user", "content": "hi" } ] }
